{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Wet City \u2013 Your Chance to Start a New Life!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wet City is a place where anyone can fulfill their dreams if they are willing to take risks. You begin your journey as an aspiring producer, and your goal is to build a career, achieve success, and outshine your competitors.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras/27cfe2e1b031d7d3404b55f1db1ef11a.poster.avif?t=1762277648\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras/27cfe2e1b031d7d3404b55f1db1ef11a.webm?t=1762277648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras/27cfe2e1b031d7d3404b55f1db1ef11a.mp4?t=1762277648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is the Game About?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wet City is a life simulator where you manage the career of a producer, creating and selling films. There are no easy paths: every mistake can cost you your reputation, money, or even your freedom. Buy equipment, negotiate with the mafia, avoid the police, expand your studio, and become famous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras/d6ac5fe3af017cd43c7c9981ef12c6c2.avif?t=1762277648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras_big/d6ac5fe3af017cd43c7c9981ef12c6c2.avif?t=1762277648 width=800 height=534 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You in Wet City?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create films with unique content:</strong> The game features over <strong>60 animations</strong> you can use in your films to captivate your audience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Produce exclusive materials:</strong> A vast collection of photos and additional content will help you stand out from the competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your studio:</strong> Purchase new equipment, improve the quality of your work, and unlock new creative possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade the police:</strong> The more successful you become, the more attention you attract. Avoid fines, destroy evidence, or pay the mafia for protection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work with the mafia:</strong> Only dark connections can solve your problems quickly and discreetly. But remember: every service comes at a price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell your films:</strong> Negotiate with buyers, set prices for your projects, and decide what\u2019s more important\u2014money or reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain popularity:</strong> The more films you create, the more fans you attract. Climb to the top and become a legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras/6695e5d1e028f01f22764a4d9345d968.avif?t=1762277648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras_big/6695e5d1e028f01f22764a4d9345d968.avif?t=1762277648 width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>60 animations</strong> to make every project unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of equipment, scenarios, and materials for your films.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive city with various locations: a tech store, a bar, a pawn shop, the mafia, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The opportunity to grow from a novice to an industry star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras/f36e30e2c7cd6a7d46a4a9c3a4adfbbc.poster.avif?t=1762277648\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras/f36e30e2c7cd6a7d46a4a9c3a4adfbbc.webm?t=1762277648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras/f36e30e2c7cd6a7d46a4a9c3a4adfbbc.mp4?t=1762277648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Path to Success</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wet City is a world where you decide your path:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A successful producer known to everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or a risk-taker who bets everything to achieve their goals.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wet City Awaits You</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scene, every frame, every step is a part of your story. Discover all the secrets of this city, unleash your potential, and become a leader in the industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras/8d66bf2f8c3362d89627e17696fc68b0.poster.avif?t=1762277648\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras/8d66bf2f8c3362d89627e17696fc68b0.webm?t=1762277648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras/8d66bf2f8c3362d89627e17696fc68b0.mp4?t=1762277648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First movie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427410/ba2dfc8f9e245a5ace4a0e3c4784b65a68de5762.jpg"},{"name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427410/ec22bb61f5c2b57bc9a506f697269d99afc8b07c.jpg"},{"name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427410/664ac7023e369df25419cc387bf235bc0c9179cf.jpg"},{"name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427410/38407a82735bb0615d25829bed8c2bbd21b7aac1.jpg"},{"name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427410/6ec37343cc758179d62634e33ff5250044166d2e.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3427410?t=1762277648","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3427410?t=1762277648","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/d4730bb4f31fe5a2c3cc5d89461cf95980c1e9c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762277648","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/d4730bb4f31fe5a2c3cc5d89461cf95980c1e9c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762277648","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Sexual Content\r\nThe game contains full nudity and graphic depictions of sexual acts between consenting adult characters. All intimate scenes occur with mutual consent. The game does not include sexual assault, coercion, non-consensual acts, or aggressive sexual behavior.\r\n\r\nSexual interactions are part of the gameplay mechanics but are not forced upon the player \u2013 they have full control over when and with whom these interactions take place.\r\n\r\nIntimate scenes include visual effects, animations, and textual descriptions. However, the game does not contain extreme forms of sexual content, such as violent fetishes, humiliation, BDSM, forced actions, or non-consensual encounters.\r\n\r\nCrime-Related Themes\r\nThe game includes crime-related elements such as interactions with a mafia system, blackmail, illegal activities, and mechanics for covering tracks. However, it does not glorify violence and does not feature extreme brutality.\r\n\r\nSome gameplay mechanics involve threats and intimidation, but these interactions do not involve direct physical violence. There are no depictions of murder, torture, or physical abuse as part of the core gameplay.\r\n\r\nPlayers may encounter situations where they are pressured by criminal organizations, but they always have choices regarding their actions. The game does not force players into a criminal path but rather provides different narrative options.\r\n\r\nAlcohol and Drug Use\r\nThe game includes depictions of alcohol consumption, such as in bars or social gatherings. Alcohol serves as an atmospheric element but does not play a significant role in gameplay mechanics.\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of drug use in the game, nor does it promote any form of drug consumption. Additionally, themes of self-harm or suicide are not present in any form."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Wet City \u2013 Your Chance to Start a New Life!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wet City is a place where anyone can fulfill their dreams if they are willing to take risks. You begin your journey as an aspiring producer, and your goal is to build a career, achieve success, and outshine your competitors.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/