> The more successful you become, the more attention you attract. Avoid fines, destroy evidence, or pay the mafia for protection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work with the mafia:</strong> Only dark connections can solve your problems quickly and discreetly. But remember: every service comes at a price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell your films:</strong> Negotiate with buyers, set prices for your projects, and decide what\u2019s more important\u2014money or reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain popularity:</strong> The more films you create, the more fans you attract. Climb to the top and become a legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras/6695e5d1e028f01f22764a4d9345d968.avif?t=1762277648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras_big/6695e5d1e028f01f22764a4d9345d968.avif?t=1762277648 width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>60 animations</strong> to make every project unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of equipment, scenarios, and materials for your films.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive city with various locations: a tech store, a bar, a pawn shop, the mafia, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The opportunity to grow from a novice to an industry star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras/f36e30e2c7cd6a7d46a4a9c3a4adfbbc.poster.avif?t=1762277648\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427410/extras/f36e30e2c